“sparsulidan t`argmna t`ea shurg'aiam.
c`nobili iraneli mcerlis mahmud doulat`abadis (1940) romani ,,polkovnikis mimcuxri" avtoris samshobloshi dg'emde ar gamok`veqnebula, t`umc`a iranis xelisup`lebis mier ,,qvelaze kontrrevoluc`iur" romanad mich`neuli es t`xzuleba araert` evropul enazea t`argmnili.
mok`medeba meoc`e saukunis 80-ian clebshi - islamuri revoluc`iis garizhrazhsa da iran-eraqis omis dros, ert`i g'amis ganmavlobashi vit`ardeba. shahis armiis gadamdgarma polkovnikma, romlist`visac` erovnuli idealebi da g'irseba mt`avar p`aseulobebs carmoadgens, shvilebi patriotebad ag'zarda da t`avisup`ali arch`evanis up`leba misc`a. sxvadasxva gzis arch`evis miuxedavad, polkovnikis shvilebi k`veqanashi momxdar politikur movlenebs ecirebian. avtoris sht`ambechdavi t`xrobis cqalobit`, mkit`xveli ara marto ert`i ojaxis tragediis, aramed mt`eli saxelmcip`os dramatuli istoriis t`anamonacile xdeba.
seria ET CETERA"œ
™margaret saimons t`u ar ic`nobt`, qvelaze gulcrp`eli bavshvi ar gc`nobiat`. t`ert`meti clis margareti gulaxdilad saubrobs imaze, rac` am asakis qvela gogonas acuxebs; rasac` xshirad malaven da z'ala ar hqop`nit`, sxvebs sakut`ar grz'nobebshi gamoutqdnen. ,,ag'araa dro, mkerdi gamezardos?" - ekit`xeba margareti g'mert`s da sabnis k`vesh damaluli st`xovs dedas, lip`i uqidos. mere ra, rom mkerdi ar ak`vs da im lip`shi bambis rgolebi unda ch`aitenos.
margaret saimonis ambebi skolis, megobrobis, saidumlo shekrebebis, bavshvuri xedvebis, pirveli koc`nis da, upirveles qovlisa, g'mert`is z'iebis ambebia, romlebic` brcqinvale iumorit`aa gajerebuli. margarets xshirad ar esmis mshoblebis da abrazebs mat`i sak`c`ieli, magram am dros sheuz'lia niu-iorkshi darekos da t`avisi dardi msop`lioshi qvelaze mxiarul da sasac`ilo bebias gauziaros. samoc`i clis silvia saimoni, romelic` t`mis p`ers t`veshi ert`xel ic`vlis da darcmunebulia, rom t`u g'amit` k`uch`ashi gava, auc`ileblad gaz'arc`vaven, mudam mzadaa, margarets mousminos.
am romanshi xdeba is, rac` qvela gogos c`xovrebashi xdeba - pirvelad da rasac` didi ganc`debi, didi sixaruli da uxerxulobebi axlavs t`an. hoda, t`u margaretis t`anatolebi xart` an t`u gindat`, c`ota xnit` bavshvobashi dabrundet` da gulianad ic`inot`, judi blumis cigni unda gadashalot`. cignis daxurvis shemdeg ki auc`ileblad itqvit`:
-ak` xar, g'mert`o? madloba, rom mkit`xvelebs margaret saimoni gvach`uk`e."¬
©shuag'amis dadgomist`anave urch`xuli ig'viz'ebs.. g'amis sich`umeshi gac`oc`xlebuli xis landi avismomascavebeli nabijebit` uaxlovdeba saxls... is konort`an modis. magram qvelaze mz'vinvare monstric` ki ver sheedreba im koshmars, g'amg'amobit` rom tanjavs bichs - cqvdiadit`, k`arit`a da kivilit` moc`ul koshmars, sazareli dasasrulit`.. xis urch`xuli , romelic` konors uxmobs, uz'velesi, ukvdavi bunebis z'alaa - mkurnali, romlis naboz'ebi camalic` autanlad mcarea. is bichisgan sanac`vlod qvelaze saxip`at`o rames moit`xovs - simart`els.
